    "1.16.3-1.0.42": "Fix a null pointer exception for blocks that do not need loot tables - noeppi_noeppi",
    "1.16.3-1.0.43": "Added a field with minecraft:missingno resource location and made NbtIngredient return the stack given on creation as matching stacks. - noeppi_noeppi",
